  <item>
    <title>45.【谈恋爱】如果上天再给我一次重来的机会，我会……</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af532c914d01a26f8a8a4e5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af532c914d01a26f8a8a4e5</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>重来未必是后悔，只是因为我变得更好了。</span></p><p><span>️🎙️主播：麦麦、小短 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;嘉宾：卢卡斯、大圆</span></p><p><span>️✂️剪辑、 整理：麦麦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a> 大圆究竟分手没？后续来了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="380">00:06:20</a> 情绪沟通失败，大圆男友提出分手，但两个很快复合了！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="606">00:10:06</a> 分手后两个人开始拉扯和折磨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1225">00:20:25</a> 高光时刻：全场劝分！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">00:24:31</a> 恋爱中的价值与成本：关系中的期望与现实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">00:33:33</a> 小短反思过往一段暧昧经历：如果再来一次，会更体面表达</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2781">00:46:21</a> 匪夷所思！麦麦哥哥竟然邀请同学、教导主任参加与女友的约会？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3189">00:53:09</a> 恋爱与消费观念：AA制与请客文化的现代解读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3815">01:03:35</a> 恋爱与婚姻中的金钱观探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4534">01:15:34</a> 反思亲密关系：正视自我感受与成长</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4766">01:19:26</a> 打破情感表达的怪圈，学会经营亲密关系</span></p><p><span>亲密关系可能是终身课题，那就让我们终身学习。</span></p>]]></description>
