  <item>
    <title>40.【谈恋爱】你是如何分手的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab2792d93d5eb3bdc795a91</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab2792d93d5eb3bdc795a91</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>️🎙️主播：麦麦、小短 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;嘉宾：Bingo、梨子</span></p><p><span>️✂️剪辑、 整理：麦麦</span></p><p><span>📖实习生：佳琪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a> 一段00后的恋情因缺乏新鲜感而结束</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="214">00:03:34</a> 来听听嘉宾的前任数量，到底谁才是“老法师”？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">00:10:09</a> Bingo：当面分手，干脆利落！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="768">00:12:48</a> 年轻时因害怕直接面对分手而采取的不体面分手方式</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">00:17:24</a> 异地恋因家庭压力导致的决绝分手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">00:23:02</a> 通过表情包分手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">00:32:36</a> 大学毕业黏糊分手</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2249">00:37:29</a> 突破底线了：婚房与个人边界</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2500">00:41:40</a> 和双鱼男的异国恋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3116">00:51:56</a> 我们谈恋爱，父母别插手！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">00:59:30</a> 追求100%的纯爱不现实</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4265">01:11:05</a> 分手了就请别再想起我</span></p><p><span>你当年是怎么说分手的呢？欢迎评论区留言告诉我们～</span></p><p><span>新一期线下播客录制时间已经发布，欢迎大家多多关注～</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
