  <item>
    <title>39.牛奶盒里藏着多少黑科技？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6aad2f93ac389df82733ef32</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aad2f93ac389df82733ef32</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>喝了这么多年牛奶，你真的了解牛奶吗？</span></p><p><span>️🎙️主播：麦麦、小短 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;嘉宾：叶景锦</span></p><p><span>️✂️剪辑、 整理：麦麦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">00:01:00</a> 研究员竟然如此年轻？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">00:03:21</a> 研究员的工作：根据市场需求选择工艺、测试配方口味、参与乳品研发。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">00:08:38</a> 常温奶与巴氏杀菌乳的差异是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">00:14:50</a> 牛奶蛋白质含量人为可控吗？牛奶口感差异也是人为因素吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1192">00:19:52</a> 干货！你的牛奶选择与健康饮用建议。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">00:30:03</a> 上海金山限定牧场鲜奶的生产与特色。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2243">00:37:23</a> Q&amp;A：牛奶配送与保存知识问答</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">00:41:51</a> Q&amp;A：口感几乎一样，但低温巴氏杀菌乳因保留更多活性物质而价格较高</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2758">00:45:58</a> 牛奶保质期与杀菌工艺解析。</span></p><p><span>又是干活满满的一天！还想了解哪些行业，留言告诉我们呀～！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvPMyTHVEIfvK2meu22DMVegIbqB.JPG"><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/645ef6fc6415787f7a632155/lpNHDpM1Ccdm9eBrLcPqIQofpANL.m4a" length="49470123" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:58</itunes:duration>
