  <item>
    <title>36.欢迎作家文吉儿！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a85af2afb87252df2ec80bb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a85af2afb87252df2ec80bb</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>青春文学，是触发大家情绪的每一件小事。</span></p><p><span>️🎙️主播：麦麦、小短 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;嘉宾：文吉儿</span></p><p><span>️✂️剪辑、 整理：麦麦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a> 文吉儿六岁时发表人生第一篇文章，竟然是因为竞选班长失败？！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> 文吉儿第一次收到用稿通知书时的惊喜，犹如拆盲盒般让人上瘾！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 写作之路：天赋与努力的辩证。25岁前依赖天赋，后期则需依靠个人努力和积累。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 从小说家到编剧：创作转型与持续性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 身份与能量：从作者到出品人的角色转换</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 工作与生活：在忙碌中寻找平衡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 少男少女心气与青春文学的探讨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 文吉儿的神仙朋友们！各个都优秀！各个都卷！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2764">46:04</a> 童年偶遇与青涩情感：文吉儿格格与五阿哥的合唱团奇缘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3482">58:02</a> 年轻评委在恋综中的成长与感悟</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4119">01:08:39</a> 现代爱情观与市场影响下的恋爱选择</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4625">01:17:05</a> 工作与生活平衡的艺术：定期休假与自我关怀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4941">01:22:21</a> 从忙碌到平静：学会放弃与接纳自我</span></p><p><span>欢迎大家留言说说自己看过的“青春文学”。</span></p><p><span>在忙忙碌碌的日子，记得也要好好吃饭！祝吉儿新书大卖！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi7mxFC47-2pibgH-y7_JXdD7miX.JPG"><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmh7sCierBxd_1buGsJgKeCtwxO-.jpg"><p></p>]]></description>
